        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Music-Powered Planet, UCISMA</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>「Music is the lifeblood of this planet, formed by the fusion of Rhythm, Melody, and Harmony.」</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UCISMA is a top-down rhythm action game where players move in sync with the beat. One day, Music vanished from the music-powered planet Ucisma due to the loss of three Absolute Artifacts. To restore it, the Supreme Elder took up the legendary sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you, as the Supreme Elder, embark on a journey to reclaim Music. Move dynamically to each stage’s rhythm and purify Ucisma!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>How To Play</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack:</strong> <i>Left-click on mouse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong> <i>Right-click on mouse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move:</strong> <i>WASD</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Game Description</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game is a rhythm action top view game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use the mouse for non-game menus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each stage has different background music and hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You have to operate to the beat and survive until the music is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If the stage is successful, the next stage will be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Additional Description</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The length of the music varies from stage to stage, usually around a minute or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The higher the score, the better the stage rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can read the story with the book-shaped icon at the bottom of the stage selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Etc.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial play and random line description right before entering the stage, will go a long way towards gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The 'HOW TO PLAY' button on the main screen enters the tutorial)</i></p>",
